```

And `captureChoiceRules()` adds to that. So ties always reroll.

What about `armyCount(state, fromId)`? In `resolve`, after each roll, if there's an actual exchange resolution, `state.armies[fromId]` gets modified. So the armyCount changes within resolve. This affects the dice counts in subsequent iterations.

Wait, looking again:
